ce so all businesses that use their platform can use WhatsApp business messages to answer customer questions, run marketing campaigns, and sell directly in chat. More...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid0YATaJGw4ySiMtSeC8nathukPifoBH6NHr7i9PQBa5C4VuxcyGV1cdBLVJxNJ38h5l","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1617","post_id":"1617","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid037ZxKAanZkB6L6qAFjdhjGsdPfHtLE4Ea8XafaT32vBJYAzZMXPjPd4pwsT4yqQzcl","published_at":null,"published_date":"2022-09-13","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1617/","text":"Most people use feeds to discover content and use messaging for deeper connections. We're building Community Chats as a new way to connect with people who share your interests. More than 1 billion...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid037ZxKAanZkB6L6qAFjdhjGsdPfHtLE4Ea8XafaT32vBJYAzZMXPjPd4pwsT4yqQzcl","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1618","post_id":"1618","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02sku2rnAaKNLsCZofNKggA7GNZi4Kxa5DkPMRqR5Ta7ozo4QMktHCDeNaqKp9ubiml","published_at":null,"published_date":"2022-09-12","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1618/","text":"Some AI news: we're moving PyTorch, the open source AI framework led by Meta researchers, to become a project governed under the Linux Foundation. \n \nPyTorch has become one of the leading AI...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02sku2rnAaKNLsCZofNKggA7GNZi4Kxa5DkPMRqR5Ta7ozo4QMktHCDeNaqKp9ubiml","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1619","post_id":"1619","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid0jx8KmgRJeHN98aqJ4ziCQ4yt51BJW1XXcR6WRiBKsNYCzasbm5KY1cWWhFi8XkPl","published_at":null,"published_date":"2022-09-06","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1619/","text":"See you at Meta Connect on Oct 11.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid0jx8KmgRJeHN98aqJ4ziCQ4yt51BJW1XXcR6WRiBKsNYCzasbm5KY1cWWhFi8XkPl","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1620","post_id":"1620","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02WYeRZj5QEVp4fL5tqTa3vyscEKYmPq4XDq9ZLzvWr1NaUv9w9vkqTPBtsHuWEAorl","published_at":null,"published_date":"2022-09-03","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1620/","text":"One of my training partners, Khai Wu, is making his UFC Fight Pass debut tonight. Go get it Khai and looking forward to a great fight!","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02WYeRZj5QEVp4fL5tqTa3vyscEKYmPq4XDq9ZLzvWr1NaUv9w9vkqTPBtsHuWEAorl","text_truncated":false}]